#04 Document and share the process

## Video shows how to clone repository locally and commit it to GitHub from visual studio

[Video demonstration posted on YouTube] (https://youtu.be/7wkP2brvF1M?is=lrce2Ht1fMsQq0Wx)

## Read

This video shows a step by step process of cloning a repository from GitHub to one's local computer.
It also shows how to commit it directly to GitHub into the specified folder you would like to commit to.
I committed my project to the evidence folder to keep the weekly consistency.